        a: "Often yes, especially if your clients are individuals or small businesses who pay digitally. A clean, numbered invoice with your business name, a professional email, and a phone number is workable. Two caveats: a name-plus-free-email invoice can look slightly less established, and some corporate AP systems require an address to set you up as a payee — so it helps to have a business address ready even if you don't print it every time.",
