        q: "How do I actually pay my quarterly taxes?",
        a: "The fastest free option is IRS Direct Pay at irs.gov/payments — it pulls from your bank account with no signup; choose 'Estimated Tax' and the correct year. You can also use EFTPS (free, good for keeping all payments in one record) or pay by card through an approved processor for a fee. Save the confirmation as proof of an on-time payment, and remember most income-tax states expect a separate state estimated payment too.",
